WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.800
- I found this out, I didn't know this,

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.860
but Will Smith is
actually playing your dad

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:05.800
in an upcoming movie, right?

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.850
- Yeah, so there's this film
coming out this year now,

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:12.698
it's called, or I imagine
it'll be this year,

00:00:12.698 --> 00:00:16.310
"King Richard," and it's very exciting.

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:17.800
It's really about my dad

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:21.990
and how he literally changed
the game and how this started.

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:23.910
He's a revolutionary kind of person,

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:27.390
and I love him to death
and my mom of course

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:29.470
is also featured in the movie and--

00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:30.303
Oh, there's my mom!

00:00:30.303 --> 00:00:33.320
She's the coolest lady on
the planet, she's so fun.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.994
But the two young ladies
that play both Serena and I,

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:38.360
they acted just like Serena and I did,

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:42.190
holding hands, hugging each
other, like how we were as kids.

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:46.690
We still like hug each other,
and it's the same thing.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:47.960
So it was really interesting to see

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:50.140
that kind of dynamic on the set.

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:53.421
And we had a lot of fun with
them, because we would say,

00:00:53.421 --> 00:00:55.970
just be careful, because in the year 2000,

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:57.800
and we'd pretend they were actually us,

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.008
you're gonna meet this guy,
don't date him, you know!

00:01:01.008 --> 00:01:02.650
(applause and laughter)

00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:03.797
- Just say no!

00:01:03.797 --> 00:01:06.200
- We had a lot of fun,
those girls are sharper

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.870
than we ever were at that age though.

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:09.996
So we don't think we
have to worry about them.

00:01:09.996 --> 00:01:11.300
- Oh my God, that's so funny.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:14.153
You're going to meet
this guy and just run.

